  "project_description": "This module provides a content type to store and present legislative content in Drupal. It also implements an API integration with the Laws.Africa Indigo platform https://github.com/laws-africa/indigo to import legislation from Akoma-Ntoso format.\n\n Features \n Content type, taxonomies to store legislative content.\n\nAPI module integrated with Migrate to import automatically legislation.\n\nSupports multilingual features and ammendment as revisions for the legislation.\n\n Post-Installation \n TODO\n\n Additional Requirements \n TODO\n\n Recommended modules/libraries \n TODO\n\n Similar projects \n TODO\n\n Supporting this Module \n TODO\n\n Community Documentation \n TODO\n\n Back to top",
